#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:4
msgid "Tuning UDF workloads"
msgstr "调优 UDF 作业"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:6
msgid ""
"When a UDF job is slow or runs out of memory, tune the input partitions, "
"batch size, and task resources separately."
msgstr "UDF 作业运行慢或内存不足时，分别调整输入分区、批次大小和任务资源。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:9
msgid "In DPE, input data and function calls are divided as follows:"
msgstr "在 DPE 中，输入数据和函数调用按下面的方式划分："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:11
msgid "Parameters controlling source chunks, task resources, and UDF batches in DPE"
msgstr "DPE 中分别控制源数据分块、任务资源和 UDF 批次的参数"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:11
msgid ".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/task-batch-model.svg"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/task-batch-model.svg\n"
"   :alt: DPE 中分别控制源数据分块、任务资源和 UDF 批次的参数"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:15
msgid ""
"Chunk settings control the input assigned to tasks and can affect "
"parallelism. ``with_running_options`` requests resources for each UDF task. "
"``batch_rows`` limits one function call, which can reduce its temporary "
"objects, but does not remove the input already held by the task. A model "
"loaded in the task also continues to occupy memory between calls."
msgstr ""
"Chunk 相关参数控制分配给任务的输入，也会影响可并行处理的工作量。``with_running_options`` 为每个 UDF "
"任务申请资源。``batch_rows`` "
"限制一次函数调用的数据量，可以减少调用过程中的临时对象，但不会释放任务已经持有的输入数据。任务中加载的模型也会在多次调用之间继续占用内存。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:21
msgid ""
"Chunk sizes are not guaranteed to be consistent between executions of the "
"same job. Choose settings according to memory use and observed performance; "
"do not rely on a previous run's chunk boundaries for correct results."
msgstr "同一个作业多次执行时，Chunk 大小也不保证一致。应根据内存占用和实际运行情况调整参数，计算结果不能依赖上一次运行的分块边界。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:25
msgid ""
"The diagram describes DPE. SQL execution has different partitioning rules; "
"the table below lists which settings each engine supports."
msgstr "上图描述的是 DPE。SQL 执行采用不同的分区规则，后文会分别说明各引擎支持的设置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:29
msgid "Choose the next adjustment"
msgstr "根据瓶颈选择下一步调整"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:31
msgid ""
"First identify the expensive or failed UDF task in :ref:`udf_debugging`. "
"Then choose the control that matches the symptom:"
msgstr "先按 :ref:`udf_debugging` 找到耗时较长或失败的 UDF 任务，再根据现象选择调整项："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:38
msgid "Symptom"
msgstr "现象"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:39
msgid "Check"
msgstr "检查什么"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:40
msgid "Adjust first"
msgstr "优先调整"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:41
msgid "Limitation"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:42
msgid "Memory grows with task input"
msgstr "输入越大，任务的内存用量越高"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:43
msgid "Input rows/bytes and largest groups"
msgstr "输入行数、字节数和最大的分组"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:44
msgid "Source chunks or repartitioning"
msgstr "读表分块或重新分区"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:45
msgid "Smaller source chunks do not split a complete group."
msgstr "缩小源数据分块不会拆开一个完整分组。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:46
msgid "Temporary objects fill memory during a batch"
msgstr "处理一个批次时，临时对象占满内存"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:47
msgid "Per-call input and intermediate objects"
msgstr "每次调用的输入和中间对象"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:48
msgid "``batch_rows``"
msgstr "``batch_rows``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:49
msgid "Does not remove task input or a loaded model."
msgstr "不会移除任务已持有的输入或已加载的模型。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:50
msgid "A few tasks exceed normal memory use"
msgstr "只有少数任务的内存需求高于正常水平"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:51
msgid "Failed attempt and retry history"
msgstr "失败记录和重试历史"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:52
msgid "DPE elastic memory"
msgstr "DPE 弹性内存"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:53
msgid "Cannot fix a leak or exceed the configured limit."
msgstr "无法解决内存泄漏，也不能超过设置的上限。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:54
msgid "Most tasks need more memory"
msgstr "大多数任务都需要更多内存"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:55
msgid "Typical peak and persistent model size"
msgstr "通常的峰值和常驻模型大小"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:56
msgid "Starting ``memory`` or input size"
msgstr "起始 ``memory`` 或输入大小"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:57
msgid "Repeated OOM retries waste time and resources."
msgstr "反复 OOM 和重试会浪费时间与资源。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:58
msgid "CPU limits throughput"
msgstr "CPU 成为吞吐瓶颈"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:59
msgid "CPU use and available parallel tasks"
msgstr "CPU 用量和可并行的任务数"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:60
msgid "Partitions or per-task ``cpu``"
msgstr "分区数或每个任务的 ``cpu``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:61
msgid "More CPUs do not parallelize a Python loop automatically."
msgstr "增加 CPU 不会自动让 Python 循环并行执行。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:63
msgid ""
"For MCSQL Fuxi workers, compare ``mem_usage`` with ``mem_plan`` in "
":ref:`logview_fuxi_sensor`. For DPE, use the relevant SubStep's Sensor entry"
" when available, and correlate its attempt with StdOut/StdErr. A missing "
"Sensor chart is not evidence of low memory use."
msgstr ""
"MCSQL 的 Fuxi Worker 可以在 :ref:`logview_fuxi_sensor` 中对比 ``mem_usage`` 和 "
"``mem_plan``。DPE 则从对应 SubStep 的 Sensor 入口查看，并结合 StdOut/StdErr 确认对应的尝试。没有 "
"Sensor 曲线，不能说明内存用量低。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:68
msgid ""
"Use representative data to compare normal tasks with the largest tasks. "
"Leave room for input data, models, temporary objects, and output. Change one"
" setting at a time, then compare peak memory, duration, and resource usage. "
"An OOM-killed process's final sample can miss its peak; do not size memory "
"from that sample alone."
msgstr ""
"用有代表性的数据，对比普通任务和最大任务的用量，为输入、模型、临时对象和输出留出空间。每次调整一个配置，再比较内存峰值、耗时和资源用量。进程因 OOM "
"被终止前的最后一个采样点可能没有记录到峰值，不能只根据这个点设置内存。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:74
msgid ""
"The controls below apply to different interfaces from "
":ref:`udf_select_function`:"
msgstr "不同参数适用于 :ref:`udf_select_function` 中的不同接口："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:81
msgid "What to adjust"
msgstr "调整什么"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:82
msgid "Example"
msgstr "设置示例"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:83
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:84
msgid "Byte-based table splits"
msgstr "按字节拆分表数据"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:85
msgid "``md.read_odps_table(..., chunk_bytes=16 * 1024**2)``"
msgstr "``md.read_odps_table(..., chunk_bytes=16 * 1024**2)``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:86
msgid ""
"In DPE, targets source chunks by bytes. In MCSQL, sets the SQL "
"``split_size`` hint. SPE ignores this parameter."
msgstr "在 DPE 中，按字节设置源数据 chunk 的目标大小；在 MCSQL 中，设置 SQL 的 ``split_size`` 提示；SPE 忽略此参数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:88
msgid "Row-based table splits"
msgstr "按行数拆分表数据"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:89
msgid "``md.read_odps_table(..., chunk_size=256)``"
msgstr "``md.read_odps_table(..., chunk_size=256)``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:90
msgid ""
"In DPE, targets rows per source chunk for transactional tables or reads with"
" ``nrows``. MCSQL and SPE ignore this parameter."
msgstr "在 DPE 中，为事务表或设置了 ``nrows`` 的读取指定每个源数据 chunk 的目标行数；MCSQL 和 SPE 忽略此参数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:92
msgid "Rows per existing chunk"
msgstr "每个数据块的行数"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:93
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``df.rechunk({0: 1000})``"
msgstr "``df.rechunk({0: 1000})``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:94
msgid ""
"Sets the target number of rows per chunk. For DataFrame and Series, this is "
"effective only in DPE."
msgstr "设置每个 chunk 的目标行数。``rechunk`` 对 DataFrame 和 Series 的调整仅在 DPE 中生效。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:96
msgid "Number of existing chunks"
msgstr "数据块的数量"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:97
msgid "``df.mf.rebalance(num_partitions=10)`` or ``df.mf.rebalance(factor=2.0)``"
msgstr "``df.mf.rebalance(num_partitions=10)`` 或 ``df.mf.rebalance(factor=2.0)``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:99
msgid "Uses an upper limit of ten chunks, or targets twice the current chunk count."
msgstr "最多分成 10 个 chunk，或将目标数量设为当前的两倍。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:101
msgid "Rows passed to one batch UDF call"
msgstr "批处理 UDF 一次接收的行数"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:102
msgid "``batch_rows=1000``"
msgstr "``batch_rows=1000``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:103
msgid ""
"Limits each batch call without changing the input chunks. Supported by "
"DataFrame, Series, and DataFrameGroupBy ``mf.apply_chunk``, and DataFrame "
"``mf.map_reduce``."
msgstr ""
"限制每次批处理调用的行数，不改变输入 Chunk。DataFrame、Series 和 DataFrameGroupBy 的 "
"``mf.apply_chunk``，以及 DataFrame 的 ``mf.map_reduce`` 都支持。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:106
msgid "Resources for one UDF task"
msgstr "单个 UDF 任务的资源"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:107
msgid "``@with_running_options(cpu=2, memory=\"8GiB\")``"
msgstr "``@with_running_options(cpu=2, memory=\"8GiB\")``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:108
msgid "Requests CPU and memory for each task, independently of its call count."
msgstr "为每个任务申请 CPU 和内存，与任务调用函数的次数无关。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:109
msgid "Memory limit for OOM retries"
msgstr "OOM 重试时的内存上限"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:110
msgid "``@with_running_options(memory=\"4GiB\", memory_limit=\"16GiB\")``"
msgstr "``@with_running_options(memory=\"4GiB\", memory_limit=\"16GiB\")``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:111
msgid ""
"For eligible DPE CPU UDF tasks, starts at 4 GiB and allows OOM retries with "
"up to 16 GiB. Does not change input chunks or batch sizes."
msgstr "符合条件的 DPE CPU UDF 任务从 4 GiB 开始，OOM 后最多增加到 16 GiB 重试，不改变输入 Chunk 或批次大小。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:117
msgid "Request resources with with_running_options"
msgstr "使用 with_running_options 调整任务资源"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:119
msgid ""
"Import ``with_running_options`` from ``maxframe.udf`` and place "
"``@with_running_options(...)`` before the UDF definition, before building "
"the MaxFrame expression that uses it. Resources are requested by each task "
"running the function."
msgstr ""
"从 ``maxframe.udf`` 导入 ``with_running_options``，在 UDF 定义前加上 "
"``@with_running_options(...)``，然后再构建使用该函数的 MaxFrame 表达式。执行该函数的每个任务都会申请相应的资源。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:124
msgid ""
"The following example extracts latency values from log messages in batches. "
"Each task running ``parse_latency`` requests two CPUs and 8 GiB of memory, "
"while each function call receives at most 1,000 rows:"
msgstr ""
"下面的示例批量提取日志中的响应时间。运行 ``parse_latency`` 的每个任务申请 2 个 CPU 和 8 GiB 内存，每次函数调用最多接收"
" 1,000 行："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:151
msgid ""
"``cpu=2`` requests two CPUs per task. ``memory=\"8GiB\"`` requests 8 GiB per"
" task; an integer such as ``memory=8`` also means GiB. These values are "
"example requests, not recommended defaults for every UDF. Account for the "
"input data, loaded models, intermediate objects, and output data when "
"choosing memory."
msgstr ""
"``cpu=2`` 表示每个任务申请 2 个 CPU。``memory=\"8GiB\"`` 表示每个任务申请 8 GiB 内存；使用整数，例如 "
"``memory=8``，单位同样是 GiB。这些数值只是示例，并非所有 UDF "
"都应使用的默认配置。选择内存大小时，需要考虑输入数据、加载的模型、中间对象和输出数据的占用。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:156
msgid ""
"With the default ``options.function.allowed_max_memory_cpu_ratio=12``, the "
"CPU request is raised when memory exceeds 12 GiB per CPU. The adjusted count"
" is ``ceil(memory_GiB / 12)`` when that is larger than the requested count. "
"For example, ``cpu=1`` with 16 GiB or 24 GiB is adjusted to two CPUs."
msgstr ""
"默认 ``options.function.allowed_max_memory_cpu_ratio=12``，即每个 CPU 最多对应 12 GiB "
"内存。超过这个比例时，CPU 申请量会上调到 ``ceil(memory_GiB / 12)``。例如，``cpu=1`` 配合 16 GiB 或 24"
" GiB 内存时，都会上调到 2 个 CPU。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:161
msgid ""
"MCSQL calculates its CU setting separately: ``max(cpu, ceil(memory_GiB / 4),"
" 1)``. Thus the two examples request 4 and 6 CU respectively, not 2 CU. This"
" is a resource setting, not an estimate of the final bill. Compare actual "
"duration and quota usage after adjusting it."
msgstr ""
"MCSQL 另行计算 CU：``max(cpu, ceil(memory_GiB / 4), 1)``。所以上面两个例子分别设置为 4 CU 和 6 "
"CU。这是资源设置，不能直接据此推算最终费用；调整后还需要比较实际耗时和 Quota 使用情况。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:166
msgid ""
"If most tasks fit in the starting memory and only a few need more, add "
"``memory_limit`` to the same decorator. Eligible DPE CPU UDF tasks can then "
"retry after an OOM with more memory. See :ref:`udf_config_elastic_memory` "
"for the configuration. If most tasks already need more memory, raise "
"``memory`` or reduce their input instead of repeatedly paying the retry "
"cost."
msgstr ""
"如果大多数任务用起始内存就能完成，只有少数任务需要更多，可以在同一个装饰器中加上 ``memory_limit``，让符合条件的 DPE CPU UDF"
" 在 OOM 后增加内存重试，配置方法见 :ref:`udf_config_elastic_memory`。如果大多数任务的内存都不够，应直接调大 "
"``memory`` 或减少输入量，避免大部分任务都先失败再重试。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:172
msgid ""
"Attach ``with_running_options`` to the callable passed to ``map``, "
"``apply``, ``flatmap``, ``GroupBy.apply``, or DataFrame, Series, grouped, "
"and Tensor ``apply_chunk``. For example, configure the function passed to "
"``Series.map`` in the same way:"
msgstr ""
"适用接口包括 ``map``、``apply``、``flatmap``、``GroupBy.apply``，以及 "
"DataFrame、Series、分组对象和 Tensor 的 ``apply_chunk``。在传给这些接口的函数上添加 "
"``with_running_options`` 装饰器。例如，传给 ``Series.map`` 的函数可以这样配置："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:191
msgid ""
"Here the function still receives one value per call. The CPU and memory "
"requests apply to the task running those calls, not to each value. Raising "
"``cpu`` does not automatically parallelize a Python loop; extra CPUs help "
"only when the computation can use them, for example through a parallel "
"library."
msgstr ""
"函数每次仍然只接收一个值，CPU 和内存是分配给执行这些调用的任务的，并不是每个值各占一份资源。提高 ``cpu`` 不会自动让 Python "
"循环并行执行；只有函数本身能使用多个 CPU，例如调用并行计算库时，增加 CPU 才可能加速。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:196
msgid ""
"Without ``engine``, MaxFrame follows the job's engine selection. To select "
"DPE for one UDF, pass ``engine=\"DPE\"`` in ``with_running_options``. MCSQL "
"also maps CPU and memory requests to its UDF worker settings; do not assume "
"its SQL tasks have DPE chunk semantics."
msgstr ""
"不指定 ``engine`` 时，MaxFrame 沿用作业的引擎选择。要为某个 UDF 指定 DPE，可以在 "
"``with_running_options`` 中设置 ``engine=\"DPE\"``。MCSQL 也会将 CPU 和内存设置应用到 UDF "
"Worker，但 SQL 任务的数据划分方式与 DPE 不同。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:202
msgid ""
"For ``map_reduce`` without a combiner, decorate the mapper and reducer "
"separately to configure their stages. With a combiner, use shared defaults "
"from :ref:`udf_config_default_resources` for the combined mapper stage; its "
"resources cannot be reliably set with the mapper or combiner decorator "
"alone."
msgstr ""
"``map_reduce`` 不使用 combiner 时，可以分别为 mapper 和 reducer 添加装饰器，配置各阶段的资源。使用 "
"combiner 时，mapper 的组合阶段应使用 :ref:`udf_config_default_resources` 中的共享默认资源；只在 "
"mapper 或 combiner 上添加装饰器，不能保证该阶段按预期申请资源。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:207
msgid ""
"Use one ``with_running_options`` decorator per UDF, combining the engine and"
" resource settings in that decorator. Stacking it can lose the inner "
"settings. A field omitted from the decorator inherits its shared default. "
"For shared settings, GPU requests, and memory-per-CPU constraints, see "
":ref:`udf_config_resources`, :ref:`udf_config_default_resources`, and "
":ref:`udf_config_precedence` rather than copying every configuration into "
"the UDF."
msgstr ""
"每个 UDF 只使用一个 ``with_running_options`` "
"装饰器，在其中合并引擎和资源设置。叠加使用可能导致内层设置丢失。装饰器未指定的字段继承共享默认值。共享配置、GPU 申请和内存与 CPU 比例限制分别见"
" :ref:`udf_config_resources`、:ref:`udf_config_default_resources` 和 "
":ref:`udf_config_precedence`，不必在每个 UDF 上重复整套配置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:218
msgid "Set chunks when reading a table"
msgstr "读表时调整数据块大小"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:220
msgid ""
"Set ``chunk_bytes`` and ``chunk_size`` in "
":func:`maxframe.dataframe.read_odps_table` to adjust source chunks for "
"subsequent ``map``, ``apply``, ``flatmap``, or ``apply_chunk`` operations. "
"Replace the table names below with tables that have ``id`` and ``raw_log`` "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"可以在 :func:`maxframe.dataframe.read_odps_table` 中设置 ``chunk_bytes`` 或 "
"``chunk_size``，调整后续 ``map``、``apply``、``flatmap``、``apply_chunk`` "
"的输入分块。下面的表名需要替换为实际包含 ``id`` 和 ``raw_log`` 列的表。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:225
msgid "Their behavior depends on the execution engine:"
msgstr "这两个参数的行为取决于执行引擎："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:227
msgid ""
"DPE uses ``chunk_bytes`` for non-transactional tables read without "
"``nrows``. Its default target is 64 MiB."
msgstr "DPE 读取非事务表且未设置 ``nrows`` 时使用 ``chunk_bytes``，默认目标大小为 64 MiB。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:229
msgid ""
"DPE uses ``chunk_size`` for transactional tables or reads with ``nrows``. "
"Its default is ``options.chunk_size`` when configured, otherwise 1,024 rows."
msgstr ""
"DPE 读取事务表或设置了 ``nrows`` 时使用 ``chunk_size``。配置了 ``options.chunk_size`` "
"时默认使用该值，否则默认为 1,024 行。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:231
msgid ""
"MCSQL converts an explicitly set ``chunk_bytes`` value to a SQL "
"``split_size`` hint and ignores ``chunk_size``."
msgstr "MCSQL 会将显式设置的 ``chunk_bytes`` 转换为 SQL 的 ``split_size`` 提示，并忽略 ``chunk_size``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:233
msgid "SPE ignores both parameters."
msgstr "SPE 忽略这两个参数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:235
msgid ""
"The following examples reuse ``parse_latency`` from the resource example. "
"This DPE example requests a smaller 16 MiB source chunk:"
msgstr "下面的例子继续使用资源配置示例中的 ``parse_latency``。这个 DPE 例子将源数据分块调小到 16 MiB："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:251
msgid ""
"``chunk_bytes`` sets a target size for source chunks; the actual sizes and "
"number of chunks may vary. A 16 MiB source chunk does not mean the pandas "
"object received by the function uses 16 MiB of memory."
msgstr ""
"``chunk_bytes`` 设置源数据分块的目标大小，实际的分块大小和数量可能有所不同。源数据 Chunk 为 16 MiB，并不代表函数收到的 "
"pandas 对象只占用 16 MiB 内存。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:255
msgid ""
"For a transactional table or a read limited by ``nrows``, this DPE example "
"reduces the target row count to 256:"
msgstr "对于事务表或受 ``nrows`` 限制的读取，下面的 DPE 示例将目标行数调小到 256："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:271
msgid ""
"If later operations repartition the DataFrame, downstream UDFs use the data "
"produced by those operations. Grouping can bring rows with the same key "
"together again, so smaller source chunks do not bound the size of a group."
msgstr "如果后续操作重新分区，下游 UDF 使用的就是这些操作产生的数据。分组会再次汇集相同键的行，因此减小源数据 chunk 并不能限制单个组的大小。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:276
msgid "Adjust existing chunks"
msgstr "调整已有数据块"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:278
msgid ""
"To change the number of rows per chunk, use ``rechunk``. The adjustment is "
"not specific to ``apply_chunk``; this example uses a scalar UDF on a table "
"with a ``value`` column:"
msgstr ""
"要调整每个 Chunk 的行数，可以使用 ``rechunk``。这个操作并不限于 ``apply_chunk``，下面用逐值处理的 UDF "
"为例，输入表需要包含 ``value`` 列："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:295
msgid ""
"Here ``0`` selects the row axis and ``1000`` is the target row count. "
"DataFrame and Series ``rechunk`` is currently effective only in DPE."
msgstr ""
"``0`` 表示按行调整，``1000`` 表示每个 chunk 的目标行数。DataFrame 和 Series 的 ``rechunk`` 目前仅在"
" DPE 中生效。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:298
msgid "To change the number of chunks, use ``rebalance``:"
msgstr "用 ``rebalance`` 调整 chunk 的数量："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:305
msgid "``num_partitions=10`` produces at most ten chunks."
msgstr "``num_partitions=10``：最多分成 10 个 chunk。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:306
msgid ""
"``factor=2.0`` targets twice the current chunk count; ``factor=0.5`` targets"
" half. DPE rounds the target to the nearest integer and keeps at least one "
"chunk."
msgstr ""
"``factor=2.0`` 将目标数量设为当前的两倍，``factor=0.5`` 则设为一半。DPE 会取最接近的整数，且至少保留 1 个 "
"chunk。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:310
msgid ""
"Do not specify ``num_partitions`` and ``factor`` together. These examples "
"use the default ``axis=0``, which adjusts row chunks."
msgstr "``num_partitions`` 和 ``factor`` 只能选一个。这里使用默认的 ``axis=0``，调整的是行方向上的 chunk。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:313
msgid ""
"Both operations reorganize the data and add execution overhead. Choose "
"``rechunk`` for rows per chunk or ``rebalance`` for the chunk count, and "
"make the adjustment once before the UDF operation that needs it. More "
"partitions can expose more work for DPE to schedule, but do not guarantee "
"more concurrent tasks: available resources and the execution plan also "
"matter."
msgstr ""
"这两个操作都会重新组织数据，增加执行开销。按行数调整时选择 ``rechunk``，按 chunk 数量调整时选择 "
"``rebalance``，通常在需要调优的 UDF 操作之前调整一次即可。更多分区可以给 DPE "
"提供更多可调度的工作，但不保证会有更多任务同时运行：实际并行度还取决于可用资源和执行计划。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:322
msgid "Set the size of one function call"
msgstr "调整函数每次处理的行数"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:324
msgid ""
"For DataFrame and Series ``apply_chunk``, use ``batch_rows`` to limit the "
"number of rows passed to each Python call:"
msgstr ""
"DataFrame 和 Series 的 ``apply_chunk`` 可以通过 ``batch_rows`` 限制每次 Python "
"函数调用接收的行数："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:338
msgid ""
"If a DPE input chunk contains 2,500 rows, this example calls "
"``parse_latency`` three times with 1,000, 1,000, and 500 rows. Reducing "
"``batch_rows`` can reduce temporary memory inside each call without changing"
" the input chunk or creating more tasks."
msgstr ""
"如果 DPE 中的一个输入 Chunk 有 2,500 行，上例会调用三次 ``parse_latency``，分别传入 1,000、1,000 和 "
"500 行。减小 ``batch_rows`` 可以减少每次调用中的临时对象，但不会改变输入 Chunk，也不会增加任务数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:343
msgid ""
"When ``batch_rows`` is omitted for ungrouped ``apply_chunk``, DPE passes "
"each input chunk to the function in one call. MCSQL uses batches of up to "
"1,024 rows by default."
msgstr ""
"对于不分组的 ``apply_chunk``，省略 ``batch_rows`` 时，DPE 每次调用传入一个完整的输入 Chunk；MCSQL "
"默认每批最多传入 1,024 行。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:347
msgid "Choose batching controls according to the interface:"
msgstr "根据接口选择批次调优方式："

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:353
msgid "Interface"
msgstr "接口"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:354
msgid "Call size and tuning"
msgstr "一次调用的数据量和调优方式"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:355
msgid "``map``, ordinary ``apply``, and ``flatmap``"
msgstr "``map``、普通 ``apply`` 和 ``flatmap``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:356
msgid ""
"The UDF receives one value or row, or the column selected by ``axis``. These"
" interfaces do not expose a ``batch_rows`` control. Tune task resources and "
"input partitions instead; for a library that accepts batches, consider "
"``apply_chunk``."
msgstr ""
"UDF 接收一个值、一行，或由 ``axis`` 选择的一列。这些接口没有 ``batch_rows`` "
"控制项，应调整任务资源和输入分区；如果使用的库支持批处理，可以考虑 ``apply_chunk``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:360
msgid "DataFrame / Series ``mf.apply_chunk``"
msgstr "DataFrame / Series ``mf.apply_chunk``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:361
msgid ""
"Use ``batch_rows`` for rows per call, independently of source chunks and "
"task resources."
msgstr "用 ``batch_rows`` 调整函数每次接收的行数，它独立于源数据 chunk 和任务资源。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:363
msgid "``DataFrameGroupBy.mf.apply_chunk``"
msgstr "``DataFrameGroupBy.mf.apply_chunk``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:364
msgid ""
"Use ``batch_rows`` to set the maximum rows per call within a group. In DPE, "
"the task receives the group data before calling the function in batches."
msgstr "用 ``batch_rows`` 设置组内每次调用的最大行数。在 DPE 中，任务先接收组数据，再分批调用函数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:367
msgid "``DataFrame.mf.map_reduce``"
msgstr "``DataFrame.mf.map_reduce``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:368
msgid ""
"``batch_rows`` applies to both stages. Use ``mapper_batch_rows`` and "
"``reducer_batch_rows`` to tune their call sizes separately."
msgstr ""
"``batch_rows`` 同时用于两个阶段；使用 ``mapper_batch_rows`` 和 ``reducer_batch_rows`` "
"可以分别调整 mapper 和 reducer 每次接收的行数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:370
msgid "``GroupBy.apply``"
msgstr "``GroupBy.apply``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:371
msgid ""
"The function receives the entire group; there is no ``batch_rows`` control. "
"Input rechunking does not split one group into independent groups."
msgstr "函数接收完整的一组，没有 ``batch_rows`` 控制项。对输入重新分块不会把一个组拆成可独立计算的多个组。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:374
msgid "``Tensor.mf.apply_chunk``"
msgstr "``Tensor.mf.apply_chunk``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:375
msgid ""
"The function receives one input Tensor chunk; there is no ``batch_rows`` "
"control. Adjust Tensor chunks instead."
msgstr "函数接收一个输入 Tensor chunk，没有 ``batch_rows`` 控制项；应调整 Tensor 的数据块。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:378
msgid ""
"For ``map_reduce``, the common ``batch_rows`` default is 1,024. A stage-"
"specific value overrides it; leaving ``mapper_batch_rows`` or "
"``reducer_batch_rows`` as ``None`` inherits the common value rather than "
"disabling batching. The word-count example in :ref:`udf_examples` "
"demonstrates mapper and reducer calls, including the MCSQL reducer's final-"
"batch ``end=True`` protocol. Preserve that protocol when changing reducer "
"batch sizes."
msgstr ""
"``map_reduce`` 共享的 ``batch_rows`` 默认值为 1,024。某个阶段显式指定行数后会覆盖该值；将 "
"``mapper_batch_rows`` 或 ``reducer_batch_rows`` 保留为 ``None`` "
"表示继承共享值，而不是禁用分批。:ref:`udf_examples` 中的词频统计示例展示了 mapper 和 reducer 调用，包括 MCSQL"
" reducer 在最后一个批次使用 ``end=True`` 的协议。调整 reducer 批次行数时需要保留该协议。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:385
msgid ""
"For ``df.groupby(...).mf.apply_chunk``, a group may arrive in several "
"batches. If the calculation needs every row of a group at once, use "
"``GroupBy.apply``. In DPE, reducing the grouped batch size can reduce per-"
"call temporary objects, but does not eliminate the memory occupied by the "
"group data. A very large group can still exhaust memory; check group sizes "
"rather than assuming that smaller source chunks or batches fix skew."
msgstr ""
"``df.groupby(...).mf.apply_chunk`` 可能将同一组数据分批传入。如果计算需要一次拿到整组数据，应使用 "
"``GroupBy.apply``。在 DPE "
"中，减小组内的批次大小可以减少每次调用中临时对象的内存占用，但不会消除组数据本身的内存占用。非常大的组仍可能导致内存不足；应检查各组大小，而不是假设减小源数据"
" chunk 或批次就能解决数据倾斜。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/udf/udf_tuning.rst:392
msgid ""
"For ``Tensor.mf.apply_chunk``, set ``chunk_size`` when creating a Tensor, or"
" use ``t.rechunk(...)``. The function is called once per input Tensor chunk."
" Preserve the array semantics when changing chunk boundaries."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``Tensor.mf.apply_chunk``，可以在创建 Tensor 时设置 ``chunk_size``，或使用 "
"``t.rechunk(...)``。每个输入 Tensor chunk 调用一次函数，调整 chunk 边界时需要保持数组计算的语义。"
